  "description": "Zhu Yunwen, who barely survived the Jingnan campaign received the souls of two of the world's strongest martial artists. The First Heavenly Demon of the Demonic Cult and Huineng, the Sixth Patriarch of the Shaolin Temple in his body and was reborn as a Pacheon. \n\nThis is where the story of the Heaven Destroyer's journey toward absolute supremacy begins! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
